# The build context is this application's own directory. fact-graph, form-builder and taxpert arrive
# as separate named build contexts (see the Dockerfile header) rather than subdirectories of this
# one, so this only needs to keep this application's own heavy, regenerable trees out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/out
**/.git
**/.bsp
**/.bloop
**/.metals

# A generated mirror: the image vendors this from the taxpert context during the build, so a
# developer's local copy must not ride along and win. The USWDS mirror under
# website-static/vendor/uswds-3.13.0/ is committed rather than generated, so it stays.
src/main/resources/credit-assistant/website-static/vendor/taxpert/
